OL,3,AAfrica's richest man to launch Kenya
OL,4,Aoil refinery despite land protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to the BBC, Dangote, who is
OL,7,FAfrica's richest man, dismissed the
OL,8,Fprotests as games played by local
OL,9,Fmarketers and international players,
OL,10,Finsisting the refinery would go ahead
OL,11,Fand would be ready by 2030 as planned.
